    "detailed_description": "Get ready for<strong> action </strong>packed <strong>battles</strong>  with bears and SHOVELS. Shovel Bear is a platform fighter with unique power ups taking inspiration from video games and <strong>ANIME</strong>. The goal of the game is simple: smack, bop, dig, and stomp your enemy bear in a 1v1 to launch them off the map and prove yourself to be the best SHOVEL BEAR! Choose from 4 unique maps, with more in development. Enjoy a carefully crafted OST as you battle your friends and CPU's in the most unique platform fighter to date!  This is the game you didn't ask for, but you TOTALLY NEED!",
